A runtime marker that distinguishes which variant of a ${fref("journeys/programming-language-theory/concepts/sum-type.td")} a value belongs to, enabling ${fref("journeys/programming-language-theory/concepts/pattern-matching.td")} to dispatch on the correct case. Not to be confused with ${fref("journeys/programming-language-theory/concepts/type-variant.td")}s, which are static properties.
